{"html":"<h1>HTML helpers</h1>\n<p>Vix UI provides small HTML helpers for building safe HTML fragments from C++.</p>\n<p>Use them when you need to generate a piece of HTML without writing a full template.</p>\n<p>They are useful for:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>small components\nserver-rendered fragments\nHTML attributes\nsafe text escaping\ndynamic tags\nlayout helpers\nforms and UI primitives</code></pre><p>For full pages, prefer templates and <code>vix::ui::View</code>.</p>\n<h2>Basic example</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/ui/html/Html.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/ui/html/HtmlAttrs.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"card\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"welcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"section\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"h1\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Vix UI\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">            vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">                \"p\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">                vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Small HTML fragments from C++.\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        attrs);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">section</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"card\"</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"welcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Vix UI&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Small HTML fragments from C++.&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">section</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><h2>Escaped text</h2>\n<p>Use <code>Html::text()</code> when the value comes from a user, a request, a database, or any untrusted source.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string username </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"&#x3C;script>alert(1)&#x3C;/script>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"p\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(username));</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">&#x26;lt;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">script</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">&#x26;gt;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">alert(1)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">&#x26;lt;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">/script</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">&#x26;gt;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><p>This prevents unsafe HTML from being rendered directly.</p>\n<h2>Raw HTML</h2>\n<p>Use <code>Html::raw()</code> only when the HTML is trusted and already generated by your application.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"div\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;strong>Ready&#x3C;/strong>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">strong</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Ready&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">strong</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><p>Do not pass user input to <code>Html::raw()</code>.</p>\n<h2>Attributes</h2>\n<p><code>HtmlAttrs</code> stores and renders HTML attributes.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"save-button\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"data-action\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"save\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Save\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        attrs);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> data-action</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"save\"</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"save-button\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Save&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><p>Attribute values are escaped automatically.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">R\"(Save \"draft\" &#x26; continue)\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">title=\"Save </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">&#x26;quot;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">draft</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">&#x26;quot;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> &#x26;amp;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> continue\"</span></span></code></pre><h2>Boolean attributes</h2>\n<p>Use boolean attributes for HTML attributes that do not need a value.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"disabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"hidden\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>Only enabled boolean attributes are rendered.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">disabled</span></span></code></pre><p>You can also remove a boolean attribute by setting it to <code>false</code>.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"disabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><h2>Conditional attributes</h2>\n<p>Use <code>set_if()</code> when an attribute should only appear in some cases.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> bool</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> active </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"nav-link\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(active, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"aria-current\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"page\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">class=\"nav-link\" aria-current=\"page\"</span></span></code></pre><h2>Open and close tags</h2>\n<p>Use <code>open_tag()</code> and <code>close_tag()</code> when you need to build HTML in multiple steps.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"container\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">open_tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, attrs);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"h1\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Dashboard\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">close_tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"container\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Dashboard&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><h2>Normal tags</h2>\n<p>Use <code>Html::tag()</code> for tags with opening and closing elements.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string title </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"h1\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello Vix\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Hello Vix&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><p>With attributes:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string title </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"h1\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello Vix\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        attrs);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Hello Vix&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><h2>Void tags</h2>\n<p>Use <code>Html::void_tag()</code> for tags that do not have closing tags.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"charset\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"utf-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string meta </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">void_tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"meta\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, attrs);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> charset</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"utf-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre><p>Common void tags include:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>meta\nlink\nimg\ninput\nbr\nhr</code></pre><h2>Doctype</h2>\n<p>Use <code>Html::doctype()</code> when generating a full HTML document.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">doctype</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;html lang=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">en</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;meta charset=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">utf-8</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;title>Vix UI&#x3C;/title>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;/head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;h1>Hello&#x3C;/h1>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;/body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"&#x3C;/html>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre><p>Output starts with:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;!</span><span style=\"color:#85E89D\">doctype</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre><h2>Practical card example</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/core.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/ui.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">  vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::App app;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [](</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)req;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs card_attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    card_attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"card\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlAttrs title_attrs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    title_attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string card </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">            \"section\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">            vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">                \"h1\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">                vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Vix UI HTML\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">                title_attrs) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">                vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">                    \"p\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">                    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">                        \"Small HTML fragments generated safely from C++.\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">            card_attrs);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">doctype</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;html lang=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">en</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;meta charset=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">utf-8</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;meta name=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">viewport</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> content=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">width=device-width, initial-scale=1</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;title>Vix UI HTML&#x3C;/title>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;/head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;body>&#x3C;main>\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        card </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;/main>&#x3C;/body>&#x3C;/html>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(html));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre><h2>Valid names</h2>\n<p>Tag names and attribute names are validated.</p>\n<p>Valid examples:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>div\nsection\ncustom-element\nsvg:path\nclass\ndata-id\naria-label\n_private</code></pre><p>Invalid examples:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>1div\nbad name\nbad/name</code></pre><p>Invalid names throw a <code>HtmlError</code>.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">try</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">      vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"1bad\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlError </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">  // invalid tag name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre><h2>Common mistakes</h2>\n<h3>Passing user input as raw HTML</h3>\n<p>Wrong:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(user_input);</span></span></code></pre><p>Correct:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(user_input);</span></span></code></pre><h3>Building full pages only with C++ strings</h3>\n<p>HTML helpers are good for small fragments.</p>\n<p>For full pages, prefer:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">View</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"dashboard.html\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre><p>Templates are easier to read and maintain.</p>\n<h3>Forgetting attributes are escaped</h3>\n<p>You do not need to escape attribute values manually.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">attrs.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">R\"(Hello \"Vix\" &#x26; C++)\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>Vix UI handles the escaping when rendering.</p>\n<h3>Using HTML helpers as a frontend framework</h3>\n<p>HTML helpers are not a virtual DOM.</p>\n<p>They are small server-side helpers for generating safe HTML.</p>\n<p>For pages, use templates.</p>\n<p>For small components, use <code>Html</code>, <code>HtmlAttrs</code>, and <code>HtmlEscape</code>.</p>\n<h2>Next step</h2>\n<p>Continue with HTML responses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/docs/modules/ui/html-response\">Open the HTML response guide</a></p>\n"}
